                        <p>✅ <strong>Georgia:</strong> 11,824 procedures validated (100% accuracy)</p>
                        <p>✅ All Medicare rates match official CMS calculations</p>
                        <p>✅ All geographic GPCI factors verified against 2025 data</p>
                        <p>✅ Hospital estimates follow approved formula</p>
                        <p>✅ Patient savings calculations accurate</p>
                        <p>✅ Database-API consistency: 100%</p>
                        <p>✅ System ready for production and additional state expansion</p>
                    </div>
                `;
